### selectionGuidance: source-derived-ergon-chefia-contract
### note: Source-derived Ergon Showcase contract (localhost:8080), not deployed on the public Quickstart host. Filters RadarChefiaSubstituicao by parent sector and hierarchical path prefix, projecting both titularNome (GET_CHF_TIT) and chefeEmExercicioNome / substitutoNome (GET_CHF_EXERC, ERGadm00480).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@sessionCookie = replace-with-ERGONSESSION-cookie-value
@xsrfToken = replace-with-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value
@orgao = 2

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ergon/radar-chefias-substituicoes/filter
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: ERGONSESSION={{sessionCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
X-Tenant: {{orgao}}

< ../../payloads/hr/ergon_chefia_radar_filter_hierarquia.json
